", "title": "vendor lock-in"}], "description": "Students learn why integrations and data movement matter for privacy, usability, and sustainability."}]}, {"id": "8e441cc1-49b1-433a-8902-e6436f6111aa", "type": "topic", "title": "Multimedia Learning, E-Learning, and Digital Content Creation", "description": "Applies multimedia learning principles to videos, slides, tutorials, simulations, and interactive resources.", "children": [{"id": "32b82bb4-781b-4a27-abaa-3d17133c1311", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Multimedia Learning Principles", "children": [{"id": "f8eace8a-2b31-4140-ae5a-0bcfee77fc99", "type": "concept", "title": "dual coding"}, {"id": "a1a7dfba-3a3e-4841-994d-9ca1dda1f7c7", "type": "concept", "title": "coherence principle"}, {"id": "d583631b-8532-4580-af35-f88f443854dc", "type": "concept", "title": "signaling principle"}, {"id": "de3c41df-a6c1-4fe6-9427-44274cc19e03", "type": "concept", "title": "spatial contiguity"}, {"id": "087f8d5d-7fe1-450d-9c5a-b33586876fe7", "type": "concept", "title": "temporal contiguity"}, {"id": "0513a179-2dc9-42fd-aff2-e1210f6999a9", "type": "concept", "title": "segmenting"}, {"id": "fe2e34da-8688-4ac6-b1fc-0b1d7a095dc6", "type": "concept", "title": "pretraining"}, {"id": "a18b7201-ee90-4801-b633-3f2f02fd8fda", "type": "concept", "title": "modality principle"}, {"id": "72a92aef-a47b-4e72-a64f-f78acfc18c12", "type": "concept", "title": "redundancy effect"}], "description": "Students apply research-based principles to avoid overloading learners and to improve attention and transfer."}, {"id": "338bd659-22ab-42b4-92c8-9e864b13fdca", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Video, Screencast, and Tutorial Design", "children": [{"id": "4a650234-5de3-42a4-88e9-5af55293b97e", "type": "concept", "title": "microlecture"}, {"id": "62eac053-1658-4668-af50-86c245641782", "type": "concept", "title": "screencast"}, {"id": "95c911d0-9c98-4e1d-a038-ae4abe3aa1d1", "type": "concept", "title": "storyboard"}, {"id": "d6318ba5-2561-4d92-9701-0e5234f9d5b3", "ty